pympacds (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add signal_action middleware.
  * Add middleware instance access (get_middleware).
  * Add D-Bus introspection access (BusIntrospect / introspect_tree).
  * Add capability tags (provides/requires) and friend-tag lookup.
  * Middleware errors are non-fatal by design.

